{"text": "Texas Pregnancy Care Network\n12885 Research Boulevard\nSuite 207\nAustin, TX 78750\n\nTPCN 1-1 Project Work Plan\n\nACTIVITY START COMPLETE\n\nFY 2007-08 Activities\nSP Services to Clients September 1, 2007 August 31, 2008\n\nStatewide Media Advertising September 1, 2007 August 31, 2008\n\nThe RAPID marketing system will advertise the RAPID 1-888-LIFE-AID toll-free patch system.\nDepending on the market, advertising may include television or radio.\n\nCommunity Awareness Conference Attendance October 1, 2008 August 31, 2009\n\nTPCN will staff a Community Awareness Booth at human services professional conferences. This will\nincrease awareness of the Texas Alternatives to Abortion Services Program and assist in recruiting other\nagencies to make client referrals to the Program.\n\nEducational Material Buy November 1, 2007 January 30, 2008\nMay 1, 2008 August 31, 2008\n\nWritten materials provided to Service Providers for use in their client service activities will have been\npre-screened by TPCN and approved by Health and Human Services Commission.\n\nSP Ongoing Site Monitoring September 1, 2007 August 31, 2008\n\nService Provider (SP) Recruitment September 1, 2007 August 31, 2007\n\nService Provider recruitment will be ongoing throughout Fiscal Year 2007-08. Evaluation Checklists will\nbe sent and Q&A Sessions will be hosted when requested by organizations meeting minimum Program\nrequirements. A targeted mail campaign to potential Service Providers (social service agencies,\npregnancy centers, maternity homes and adoption agencies) will occur in October. Responders will\nreceive Evaluation Checklists and attend Q&A session before submitting applications and receiving\n\ntraining.\n\nLetters to candidate Service Providers October 1, 2007 October 31, 2007\nEvaluation checklist to responders October 15, 2007 August 31, 2008\nQ & A Session for potential SP\u2019s November 2007 August 31, 2008\nSP Review and Approval November 2007 August 31, 2008\n\nSP Ongoing Approval November 2007 August 31, 2008",
